          "RequestBodyInspection": {
            "backendName": "request_body_inspection",
            "description_en": "The request body inspection configuration. Controls the deep packet inspection behavior of WAF for HTTP request bodies. After this feature is enabled, content-based matching rules such as SQL injection and XSS detection take effect on request bodies.\n\nThis configuration can contain the following fields:\n`Id`: The unique identifier of the built-in inspection rule.\n`SizeLimit`: The maximum size of the request body to inspect.\n`Action`: The action to take when the request body exceeds the size limit",
            "description_zh": "请求体（Request Body）检测配置。用于控制 WAF 对 HTTP 请求体的深包检测行为（如启用后 SQL 注入 / XSS 等基于请求体内容的匹配才会生效）。\n\n可包含以下字段：\n`Id`：内置检测规则的唯一标识\n`SizeLimit`：请求体检测大小上限\n`Action`：超过大小限制时的处置动作",
            "properties": {
              "Action": {
                "backendName": "action",
                "description_en": "The action to take when the request body size exceeds `SizeLimit`.\n\nCommon values (the complete enumeration is subject to the server-side configuration):\n`allow`: Allow directly without performing deep packet inspection on the excess portion.\n\nThe complete enum is subject to the WAF server-side configuration",
                "description_zh": "请求体大小超过 `SizeLimit` 时的处置动作。\n\n常用取值（完整枚举以服务端为准）：\n`allow`：直接放行，不对超过部分做深包检测\n\n完整 enum 以 WAF 服务端为准",
                "example": "allow",
                "title": "超限执行动作",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "Id": {
                "backendName": "id",
                "description_en": "The request body inspection rule ID (unique identifier of the built-in rule). When request body inspection is enabled, the server uses this ID to associate the matching logic of the built-in inspection rule. The ID value is subject to the WAF built-in rule list",
                "description_zh": "请求体检测规则 ID（内置规则的唯一标识）。当开启请求体检测时，服务端使用该 ID 关联内置检测规则的匹配逻辑。ID 取值以 WAF 内置规则列表为准",
                "example": "10000001",
                "format": "int64",
                "title": "规则ID",
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "SizeLimit": {
                "backendName": "size_limit",
                "description_en": "The maximum size of the request body to inspect, in bytes.\n\nWhen the request body is less than or equal to this value, the entire content is subject to WAF matching.\nWhen the request body exceeds this value, the action specified in the `Action` field is taken (for example, inspect only the first N bytes, reject, or allow directly).\n\nThe specific value range and default value are subject to the WAF server-side configuration",
                "description_zh": "请求体检测大小上限（单位：字节）。\n\n当请求体小于或等于本值时，完整内容参与 WAF 匹配。\n当请求体超过本值时，按 `Action` 字段指定的动作处置（例如只检测前 N 字节、拒绝、直接放行）。\n\n具体取值范围、默认值以 WAF 服务端配置为准",
                "example": "16KB",
                "title": "检测大小限制",
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "title": "请求体检测配置",
            "type": "object"
          },
